{"unit_id":"Waldsatte__dsh-theme-taojian#card-zh","repo":"Waldsatte/dsh-theme-taojian","commit":"ec2b237a94dad0aa183c1c361beaa7771fdc3ebc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"陶笺 Taojian（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH Web 带来温暖纸色、陶橙点缀和衬线字体风格。它通过客户端注入 DSH theme，并覆盖主题 token 与 CSS。主要调整背景、侧栏、边框、文字、按钮、选中行、焦点轮廓及代码字体，并为浅色和深色模式分别设置颜色。适合希望将 DSH 网页界面改成柔和纸本文档风格的用户。使用前按 README 给出的命令安装；源码未要求 API key 或额外账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:138-193","client.js:144-176","client.js:31-135"]}
{"unit_id":"Waldsatte__dsh-theme-taojian#card-en","repo":"Waldsatte/dsh-theme-taojian","commit":"ec2b237a94dad0aa183c1c361beaa7771fdc3ebc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Taojian is a DSH Web theme with paper tones, clay accents, and serif fonts. It overrides theme tokens and CSS for backgrounds, text, controls, and code. Light and dark modes have separate colors. Use it to give the web interface a softer paper-like style. No API key or account is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:138-193","client.js:144-176","client.js:31-135"]}
