{"unit_id":"Waldsatte__dsh-theme-taojian#feature-1","repo":"Waldsatte/dsh-theme-taojian","commit":"ec2b237a94dad0aa183c1c361beaa7771fdc3ebc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"陶笺 Taojian 的功能「浅色与深色主题配色」：为 DSH 主题 token 设置背景、侧栏、文字、边框和按钮颜色，并分别提供浅色与深色取值。客户端应用主题时启用这些覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:144-176"]}
{"unit_id":"Waldsatte__dsh-theme-taojian#feature-2","repo":"Waldsatte/dsh-theme-taojian","commit":"ec2b237a94dad0aa183c1c361beaa7771fdc3ebc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"陶笺 Taojian 的功能「界面与代码字体」：将常规界面和 Markdown 字体设为中文衬线字体，并将代码、终端相关区域设为等宽字体。主题客户端注入相应 CSS。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:17-18","client.js:45-71"]}
{"unit_id":"Waldsatte__dsh-theme-taojian#feature-3","repo":"Waldsatte/dsh-theme-taojian","commit":"ec2b237a94dad0aa183c1c361beaa7771fdc3ebc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"陶笺 Taojian 的功能「聊天界面细节样式」：调整新会话行、会话和项目行、选中状态、图标、链接和键盘焦点的视觉样式。客户端主题激活时自动应用 CSS，清理时移除样式。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:82-135","client.js:178-189"]}
